<title>JAPAN: AUG NIKKEI 225 OPTIONS SEEN SETTLED AT 19,277.63.</title>
<headline>AUG NIKKEI 225 OPTIONS SEEN SETTLED AT 19,277.63.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>August Nikkei 225 options were seen settled at 19,227.63 on Friday morning, market sources said.</p>
<p>The official settlement price will be announced by the Osaka Securities Exchange after the market closes.</p>
